DBA: the database (dbm-style) abstraction layer, with the cdb, inifile
and flatfile handlers.

The module dba of PHP 8.2 for php82 of azsupport/ports, which installs
side by side with the other versions of PHP: lib/php/20220829/dba.so,
loaded by its ini in etc/php82/conf.d, its headers in
include/php82/php/ext/dba.
